	(text "OpenMUPP v1 PIC high-voltage adapter (adapter ID slot 9, R1 = 91k 1 %)\nTargets: PIC ICSP, high-voltage and low-voltage entry. PICkit 4/5 8-pin: pins 1 to 6 are the same.\n\nJ1 plugs directly onto J4 of the OpenMUPP v1 probe. Pin numbers of J1 are the J4 pin numbers.\nJ4 pin 2 (reserved) stays open. J4 pin 16 (adapter ID) never goes to the target. J4 pin 18 (AUX2) is not used.\nMCLR_VPP connects directly to J4 pin 19. The probe sets the three MCLR levels on pin 19:\nreset = 0 V (Q6 on the probe), run = VTREF (10k and BAT54 on the probe), program = VPP.\nJ3 debug UART: labels are from the probe side (RX = probe input)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
